[h2]Build 0.9.55[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Copy and paste fuel bills[/b], as with vanilla bills: copy one burner's fuel bill (its allowed fuels and search radius) and paste it onto others, from buttons on the burner or the icons in the fuel bill window. Select several burners to paste onto all of them.
[/list]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*]The fuel bill's [b]search radius now shows as a ring on the map[/b] while you drag the slider, and whenever the burner is selected.
[/list]
